# A variable is visible from its line on (sequential visibility): the read of `later` stands above `int: later 7`, which is not reached yet, and
# nothing outside gives the name -- the refusal 3 comes at the read, after the effect above it (seen 5, after 0).
# наблюдение явной записью: локалы не публикуются (#flush-receiver-contract)
(
    Observed:
        int: seen 0
        int: after 0
)
sub: main ()
    @: shared node[0]
    shared\Observed\seen := 5
    int: a later
    int: later 7
    shared\Observed\after := a
main()
